"Expansion adding colony tiles, player colonies, and trade fleets"
CLASS ColoniesExpansion : GameOption

"A colony tile selected for the eventual game; concrete subtypes come from colonies.json5"
ABSTRACT CLASS SelectedColonyTile : System { HAS MAX 1 This }

"Select colony tiles through gameplay setup tasks rather than naming them in the setup world"
CLASS DeferredColonySelection : System { HAS MAX 1 This }
